@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Enqueue an HH parsing job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hh/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preset": {
    "key": "php",
    "label": "PHP",
    "query": "PHP"
  },
  "exclusions": {
    "vacancyIds": [123456789],
    "titleCategories": ["SEO", "QA"]
  }
}

### Check the OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
